  "body": "Don’t miss your opportunity to view this weekend and secure an affordable brick home on a generous full site.\r\n\r\nOccupying a substantial 852 square metre section at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac is this solid 1960’s brick home. Rich in character and refreshed throughout, the home blends traditional warmth with contemporary comfort. Fresh paint, new lighting and new carpets create an inviting environment, allowing you to just move in and enjoy all the home has to offer.\r\n\r\nPositioned to enjoy all day sun, with numerous doors opening out to the garden and patios that provide great indoor/outdoor flow, and plenty of summer breeze through the home on those warmer days.\r\n\r\nThe spacious, light filled living and dining area offers ample room for family gatherings and everyday living. The adjoining kitchen, featuring a practical breakfast nook, overlooks the expansive back yard where children can play, kick a ball and enjoy the freedom of a generous family section.\r\n\r\nThe three bedrooms share a family bathroom and separate toilet. The walk-through study area takes you to the stairway leading to the lower-level, that features a fourth bedroom or rumpus room, together with a second bathroom, offering excellent flexibility for teenagers, extended family, guests or those working from home.\r\n\r\nSituated beneath the home is a single garage with ample storage and a large laundry room with practical access to the back garden.\r\n\r\nPartially embraced by established greenery, the leafy surrounds create a cool and peaceful setting, offering a welcome retreat from the everyday.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Lloyd Elsmore Park, local restaurants, cafes, gyms, with easy access to Howick Village, the Half Moon Bay ferry service to the city, Pakuranga Highway and public transport.\r\n\r\nIn zone for Pakuranga College, Howick Intermediate and Howick Primary, this is a home that offers families the opportunity to settle in, enjoy the space and comfort on offer, and explore further enhancements over time to unlock its future potential.\r\n\r\nA welcoming family home with solid foundations, generous grounds and plenty of scope to make it your own.",
